t: 1 tablet twice daily after meals: 1 tablet twice daily after meals · Oral\\n\\nTelmisartan 80mg tablet: 1 tablet once daily in the morning: 1 tablet once daily in the morning · Oral\\n\\nGlimepiride 1mg tablet: 1 tablet once daily before breakfast: 1 tablet once daily before breakfast · Oral\",\"en\":\"आपके रिकॉर्ड के अनुसार, आपकी अभी 3 दवाइयाँ चल रही हैं:\\n\\nआपकी सक्रिय दवाइयाँ (Active Medications)\\n• Metformin 850mg tablet: 1 गोली दिन में दो बार, खाना खाने के बाद लें।\\n• Telmisartan 80mg tablet: 1 गोली रोज़ सुबह लें।\\n• Glimepiride 1mg tablet: 1 गोली रोज़ सुबह नाश्ते से पहले लें।\\n\\nMetformin 850mg tablet: 1 tablet twice daily after meals: 1 tablet twice daily after meals · Oral\\n\\nTelmisartan 80mg tablet: 1 tablet once daily in the morning: 1 tablet once daily in the morning · Oral\\n\\nGlimepiride 1mg tablet: 1 tablet once daily before breakfast: 1 tablet once daily before breakfast · Oral\",\"medications\":[{\"name\":\"Metformin 850mg tablet\",\"dosage\":\"1 tablet twice daily after meals\",\"frequency\":\"1 tablet twice daily after meals\",\"status\":\"active\"},{\"name\":\"Telmisartan 80mg tablet\",\"dosage\":\"1 tablet once daily in the morning\",\"frequency\":\"1 tablet once daily in the morning\",\"status\":\"active\"},{\"name\":\"Glimepiride 1mg tablet\",\"dosage\":\"1 tablet once daily before breakfast\",\"frequency\":\"1 tablet once daily before breakfast\",\"status\":\"active\"}]}","MEDICATION_QUERY","medication-agent",7114,"COMPLETED","17d9aa3b-be2f-4958-895a-5bd740cc2b39"]
